# Third-Party Licenses

This file lists the third-party crates this workspace depends on, grouped by
license, with each license text. It is generated by
[cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
(`.github/about/about.toml` + this template) and committed at the repository
opening; regenerate with:

```sh
cargo about generate --config .github/about/about.toml \
    .github/about/about.hbs > THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
```

The workspace itself is MIT-licensed (see `LICENSE`); this document covers
the attribution obligations of the third-party code it depends on.

